  "name": "Question 14",
  "problem": "Simplify the statement $R∧(Q∨(Q∧Q)).$",
  "worked_solution": "First, the expression $Q∧Q$ simplifies to just $Q.$ \n\nSo, the given statement can be simplified to \n\n$$\nR∧(Q∨Q).\n$$\n\nThen, the expression $Q∨Q$ simplifies to just $Q.$\n\nSo, the given statement can be simplified to \n\n$$\nR∧Q.\n$$",
